OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and grey start
OL,6,Fto Thursday. Perhaps the odd brighter
OL,7,Fspell developing through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Chilly with a brisk wind,
OL,9,Fespecially towards the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy and dry overnight with
OL,12,Fan increasing southeasterly wind that
OL,13,Fwill become strong at times near the
OL,14,Fcoast. Becoming cold, with a patchy
OL,15,Ffrost developing towards dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCloudy and grey on Friday with
OL,18,Frain spreading east through the day.
OL,19,FChilly, especially by night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
